dh-job-la-district-head-name = District head
dh-job-la-district-head-desc = Run the district office and keep the district alive through the unrest.
dh-job-la-district-staff-name = District official
dh-job-la-district-staff-desc = Work in the district office: papers, residents, emergencies.
dh-job-la-office-worker-name = Office worker
dh-job-la-office-worker-desc = Work in the offices of the Gates business centre.
dh-job-la-entrepreneur-name = Small business owner
dh-job-la-entrepreneur-desc = Run your shop, cafe or stall and keep it from being looted.
dh-job-la-factory-worker-name = Factory worker
dh-job-la-factory-worker-desc = Work at the district factory and warehouse.
dh-job-la-utility-worker-name = Utility worker
dh-job-la-utility-worker-desc = Keep the substation, the sewers and the water running.
dh-job-la-metro-worker-name = Metro worker
dh-job-la-metro-worker-desc = Keep the metro station on the square working.
dh-job-la-resident-name = Resident
dh-job-la-resident-desc = Live through another day in the district.
dh-job-lav-representative-name = Corporate representative
dh-job-lav-representative-desc = Represent LA-V in the district. Do business with whoever pays, and leave alive through LZ-1 Aeronautics.
dh-job-lav-assistant-name = Representative's assistant
dh-job-lav-assistant-desc = Assist the corporate representative and run the office.
dh-job-lav-security-name = LA-V security officer
dh-job-lav-security-desc = Guard the representative and the LA-V office.
dh-job-lav-employee-name = LA-V employee
dh-job-lav-employee-desc = Work in the LA-V office.
dh-job-lamp-chief-name = Military Police chief
dh-job-lamp-chief-desc = Command the district Military Police: find the LFFC leaders and protect the residents.
dh-job-lamp-deputy-chief-name = Deputy chief of the Military Police
dh-job-lamp-deputy-chief-desc = Lead the patrols in the field and stand in for the chief.
dh-job-lamp-investigator-name = Military Police investigator
dh-job-lamp-investigator-desc = Investigate, interrogate the detained and find out who leads the Front.
dh-job-lamp-warden-name = Military Police prison warden
dh-job-lamp-warden-desc = Guard the cells of the Military Police station and the detained in them.
dh-job-lamp-officer-name = Military Police officer
dh-job-lamp-officer-desc = Patrol the district, detain the LFFC fighters and do not shoot civilians.
dh-job-lamp-cadet-name = Military Police cadet
dh-job-lamp-cadet-desc = Learn the job from the officers. Rubber rounds first.
dh-job-la-front-leader-name = LFFC squad leader
dh-job-la-front-leader-desc = Lead the cell: hold the district, blow up the factory or broadcast the manifesto. Hide among the residents.
dh-job-la-front-saboteur-name = LFFC saboteur
dh-job-la-front-saboteur-desc = Blow up what the squad leader points at. Hide among the residents.
dh-job-la-front-specialist-name = LFFC specialist
dh-job-la-front-specialist-desc = A marksman of the Front: hit officers and gunners from afar. Hide among the residents.
dh-job-la-front-machinegunner-name = LFFC machine gunner
dh-job-la-front-machinegunner-desc = Hold the street with the Firestarter-2T. Hide among the residents.
dh-job-la-front-rebel-name = LFFC rebel
dh-job-la-front-rebel-desc = Fight for the Front and follow your squad leader. Hide among the residents.
